  "description": "Backtracking for coding interviews: the choose, explore, unchoose template for subsets, permutations, combination sums with dedup, string partitioning and board search (Word Search, N-Queens, Sudoku), with pruning, complexity and tested templates in Go, C++, Java and Python.",
  "hero": {
