    "attrs": {
      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">45 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Pattern primer</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Backtracking</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Backtracking</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Build an answer one choice at a time, go deeper, and undo the choice on the way back so the next option starts clean. One template (choose, explore, unchoose) solves subsets, permutations, combination sums, string partitions and board searches like Word Search, N-Queens and Sudoku. The skill interviewers test is the details: start index versus used[], removing duplicates, and pruning.</p>\n  <p class=\"small prereq\"><b>Before this page:</b> recursion and the call stack, and Big-O for exponential growth (2<sup>n</sup>, n!). DFS on a grid helps for the board section.</p>\n"
  },
